<title>MOLDOVA: Moldovan 28-day t-bill yield falls, 91-day rises.</title>
<headline>Moldovan 28-day t-bill yield falls, 91-day rises.</headline>
<dateline>CHISINAU 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The annualised yield on Moldovan 28-day Treasury bills fell to 23.89 percent at an auction on Tuesday from 26.60 percent at the previous auction on October 1, a National Bank official told Reuters.</p>
<p>The yield on 91-day T-bills rose to 29.73 percent from 29.26 percent.</p>
<p>Full details of the 28-day T-bill auction:</p>
<p>						 Oct 8	   Oct 1</p>
<p>    Issue volume			   3.00 million lei  3.00 million lei</p>
<p>    Denominations			  1,000 lei     1,000 lei</p>
<p>    Nominal demand			 12.83 million     6.17 million</p>
<p>    Volume sold			    3.00 million	3.00 million</p>
<p>    Yield				    23.89 pct     26.60 pct</p>
<p>    Price				    98.2 pct	98.0 pct</p>
<p>    Range of bids			  97.8-98.5 pct 97.6-98.1 pct</p>
<p>    Maturity				 Nov 7, 1996   Oct 31, 1996</p>
<p>Full details of the three-month T-bill auction:</p>
<p>						 Oct 8	   Oct 1</p>
<p>    Issue volume			   10.00 million lei 10.00 million lei</p>
<p>    Denominations			  1,000 lei     1,000 lei</p>
<p>    Nominal demand			 10.84 million     13.64 million</p>
<p>    Volume sold			    10.00 million     10.00 million</p>
<p>    Yield				    29.73 pct     29.26 pct</p>
<p>    Price				    93.1 pct	93.2 pct</p>
<p>    Range of bids			  93.0-94.0 pct 90.9-94.1 pct</p>
<p>    Maturity				 Jan 9, 1997   Jan 2, 1997</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
